@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title Class Diagram - UC-52 Notify User Return Status

class "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as UI <<boundary>>
class "ReturnsController" as Controller <<controller>>
class "ReturnsService" as Service <<service>>
class "ReturnRequest" as ReturnRequest <<domain>>
class "Bill" as Bill <<domain>>
class "OrderEmailService" as OrderEmailService <<domain>>

UI --> Controller : Return status notification service recommended
Controller --> Service : delegates
Service --> ReturnRequest : uses
Service --> Bill : uses
Service --> OrderEmailService : uses
Service --> "Gmail SMTP" : email notification

note right of UI
UC-52 - Notify User Return Status
Actors: System
Pre: Return status thay đổi
Post: Email được gửi cho user
end note
@enduml
